OL,3,GNEWSARail services cancelled due to
OL,4,Asignalling fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA signalling fault between Birmingham
OL,7,FMoor Street and Small Heath resulted in
OL,8,Fdozens of cancelled services and hours
OL,9,Fof delays and cancellations.
OL,11,FThe fault shut all lines between the
OL,12,Fstation and Small Heath, with services
OL,13,Funable to operate between Moor Street
OL,14,Fand Leamington Spa and
OL,15,FStratford-upon-Avon.
OL,17,FServices, including those to London
OL,18,FMarylebone, were either cancelled or
OL,19,Fran on shortend routes. Lines reopened
OL,20,Fduring Monday afternoon, but the
OL,21,Fdisruption was still expected to
OL,22,Fcontinue.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
