OL,3,GNEWSARail services cancelled due to
OL,4,Asignalling fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was the second time in less than a
OL,7,Fweek that services were disrupted. No
OL,8,Fservices were able to pass through the
OL,9,Fstation on Thursday morning due to a
OL,10,Ffault with the station's signalling
OL,11,Fsystem.
